      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Script → per-section SRT\n\n1. **Load audio** (red, left) — upload the recording of your narration.\n2. **script** (in the Align node) — paste your script; a **blank line** starts a new section. Each section becomes **one SRT cue**.\n3. **language** — leave `auto`, or set `ru` / `en` / `zh`.\n4. Press **Run** — WhisperX aligns your exact text to the speech and writes an SRT with one cue per section (exact start/end). A **⬇ Download SRT** button appears when it finishes.\n\nSections whose words aren't found in the audio (e.g. a line you skipped while reading) are dropped and logged. Runs best on a GPU tier."
      ],
      "color": "#333",
      "bgcolor": "#444"
    },
